{"id":"61a9386f2a01b571","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-omitting-types.md","title":"Omitting Types","display":"df-omitting-types — Omitting Types","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-omitting-types","aliases":["93-df-omitting-types"],"display":"df-omitting-types — Omitting Types","depends_on":["[[93-df-type]]","[[93-df-model]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-omitting-types"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-omitting-types</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omitting-types — Omitting Types"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03527aba4c537723\" href=\"?note=03527aba4c537723\" title=\"93-df-type\">93-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> is an <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>-theory, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span> is a first-order model candidate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(\\bar x)\">\\(p(\\bar x)\\)</span> is a type over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> in an injective finite variable tuple <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar x\">\\(\\bar x\\)</span>; its length is bound inside the definition.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span> is the carrier of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}\\)</span> (omitting-types predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type}_{93}\\)</span> (type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03527aba4c537723\" href=\"?note=03527aba4c537723\" title=\"93-df-type\">93-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}\\)</span> (model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x])\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x])\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Theory, language, and variable tuple are all carried into the type call; otherwise “the same” set of formulas could change consistency or realization meaning with an ambient context.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"03527aba4c537723","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"03527aba4c537723","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Type}_{93}$ (type predicate, see [[93-df-type]])","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}$ (model predicate, see [[93-df-model]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"p(\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar x","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omitting\\text{-}types}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Omit}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,p,T,\\bar x;\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Mod}_{93}(\\mathfrak A,T;\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Type}_{93}(p,\\bar x;T,\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\\bar x:n\\hookrightarrow\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak A|^n\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in p\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi[\\bar a/\\bar x])\\Bigr]","display":true}],"bytes":1390,"backlinks":[{"id":"840f3a795c44b39b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["03527aba4c537723","2e6273b8ebf2e31a"]}